{"name":"The Art of Seduction","hex":"#dd0088","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"art","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-2 & ISO 639-5 language code for artificial languages."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The conscious production or arrangement of sounds, colours, forms, movements, or other elements in a manner that affects the senses and emotions, usually specifically the production of the beautiful in a graphic or plastic medium.","The creative and emotional expression of mental imagery, such as visual, auditory, social, etc."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/art"},{"term":"seduction","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of seducing.","The felony of, as a man, inducing a previously chaste unmarried female to engage in sexual intercourse on a promise of marriage."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/seduction"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Art of Seduction","blocks":[{"text":"The Art of Seduction (2001) is the second book by American author Robert Greene. The book examines various seduction strategies that humans have employed, and was an international bestseller."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d5/Art_of_Seduction_Cover.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Art_of_Seduction"},{"title":"The Art of Seduction (film)","blocks":[{"text":"The Art of Seduction is a 2005 South Korean romantic comedy film directed by Oh Ki-hwan, and starring Son Ye-jin and Song Il-kook. It was released on 21 December 2005."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/9a/The_Art_of_Seduction.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Art_of_Seduction_(film)"},{"title":"Art","blocks":[{"text":"Art is a diverse range of cultural activity centered around works utilizing creative or imaginative talents, wh